WEBVTT

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:03.110
It looks like our neighboring 
country, Biscotti,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.770
...and their Hero is having 
a peaceful time, too.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.960
However, it looks as though her highness

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.030
Leo has something that 
is troubling her...

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.320
As her aides, we must find 
out what is going on...

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.620
Declaration of War

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:02.640
Princess!

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.980
Starting work so early,

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:07.640
I don't think that is 
good for your health...

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:11.020
But I'm meeting Sink this morning...

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.770
...so before I have some fun

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:19.630
The mass production of 
weapons... very good,

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:22.910
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.780
The leaders at the business 
association were

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:27.480
so excited
with the past two victories that

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.040
they worked hard on it.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:32.680
I must give the leaders a reward...

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:36.640
Shall I have Amelita 
make the arrangements?

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:37.550
Yes, please.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:42.050
Okay... that's it for the morning!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.560
Emilio...

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:47.980
This one, she's the princess's 
celkul, isn't she?

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.950
That's Harlan. She's a flying celkul,

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.810
something you rarely find 
anywhere in Flonyald.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.120
Really, So you're pretty rare, huh?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.720
-Sink! Did you wait long?

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.950
I can't believe Harlan 
is acting that way!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:17.420
I'm happy she likes me, but... help...

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.160
It feels great to take a ride so early

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.430
in the morning, doesn't it?

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.430
Yes, indeed!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:41.030
Isn't it beautiful?
This is my secret place.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.950
Princess, what do you do here?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:55.380
Um, well, I take slow 
walks, or eat lunch...

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.510
That sounds nice...

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.390
But would you like to get

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:01.200
some exercise before that?

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:05.300
This was something I 
tried out yesterday...

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.670
Are you ready?

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.910
I'm going to throw this,

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:16.060
so I want you, Princess, to catch it.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.070
Okay.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.570
Ready, go!

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.490
Huh?

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.580
Princess, go!

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:23.570
Yes!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.320
Wa, wait!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.650
Hey, nice catch! Oh!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.050
Princess.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.480
Are you okay?

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.550
Oh, yes I'm okay!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:52.310
What do I do once I've caught it?

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.460
Throw it over here...

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.190
Hold it like this... See?

00:04:57.320 --> 00:05:00.370
Umm, like this?

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:01.490
Right!

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.070
Like this... and yah!

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:07.070
Whoa! Oh, good!

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.430
Sink!

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.170
Yeah!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.020
This is so much fun!

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.060
Yup! Let's play some more!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:29.530
Yes! Okay, now I'm going 
to throw really hard...

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.770
Whoa! That's high!

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:39.050
Sorry Sink, you can get it!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.520
But, maybe it's too high?

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:47.950
Palladion! Form Stick!
 One that's a bit long!

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:51.240
Huh?

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.500
Alright! Tornader!

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.510
Thanks! That'll do.

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:16.470
It's been a while since

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:20.230
I ran this much or shouted this loud...

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:23.020
But really, Sink, you're amazing!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.530
You can use not only your shine power

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.030
and seal powers,
but also Palladion!

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.810
And not just as a weapon

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.970
but dividing it and 
turning it into items!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:35.540
It's like the Palladion itself 
is teaching me how to use it.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.330
Like what she can do 
and what she can't...

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:42.710
That's probably because 
Palladion likes you, too.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.350
I hope so.

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:47.470
I'm sure of it!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.680
But Palladion is a sword, right?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.010
It doesn't feel like I could 
turn it into a sword...

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.930
When it's really necessary,
 it will turn into one for you...

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.220
I thinks it's just that you 
never really needed it.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:04.150
I am the ruler of Biscotti,

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.480
But it hasn't appeared 
for me, not once yet...

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.520
The treasured sword of Biscotti...

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:19.830
Yes... it is the counterpart of 
Sink's Divine Sword Palladion.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.760
It is the sign of the 
ruler of Biscotti...

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.090
Such a big legend to 
such a small ring...

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:30.340
Yes... Our neighboring country,

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.560
The magical battle axe Grand Vert

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.760
Many other countries also have

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:42.060
this tradition of a pair 
of treasured swords...

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.760
I see...

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.810
When I leave,

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.450
I'll have to give it 
back, this Palladion.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.040
Yes...

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.260
But, if you summon me again,

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:03.960
Huh? You would come back?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.760
If I go home, you can't summon me again?

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.560
Oh, no! Of course not!

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:14.970
Then, please summon me, please!

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:16.520
I will!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.220
I will summon you!

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.480
I'm glad...

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:25.020
So am I...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.980
Yes... thank you, Princess.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.660
Oh, sorry... I shouldn't have, right?

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:36.030
No, no! I was just surprised...

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.320
Can I keep going?

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.200
If you don't mind, please.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.800
Princess, your hair is so soft...

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.040
Thank you... very much...

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.140
Your cheek is so smooth.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.550
That tickles...

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:56.180
How about this?

00:08:56.980 --> 00:09:00.490
No, that tickles, too!
Try here, like this...

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:02.180
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:08.810
Oh, Yukikaze, how was 
your trip this time?

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.650
It was pretty much the same...

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.660
We took it slow, just Oyakata-sama,

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.540
I received your letter 
reporting on the trip

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.910
and heard of the result 
of your hunting, but...

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.740
I would like to hear about 
the most important thing,

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:26.570
Hmmm, well that is something

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:29.420
I really want to talk about, too.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.030
The hunt for Magatachi

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.880
is a rather secret mission 
of the Oyakata-sama...

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:38.200
I was told pretty strictly
not to talk about it.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.390
I knew it...

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:41.430
It's unfortunate...

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:47.440
But he said that I can talk 
about anything else...

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.430
All the fun and thrilling 
tales of our journey...

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:55.280
We'd love to hear them!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:03.370
The weather today throughout 
Biscotti will be sunny and warm.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.870
Princess, how was your 
walk with the Hero?

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:07.850
It was so much fun!

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.180
That's great!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.290
This is Percy Gaudi, reporting from

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:16.510
the Vannette Castle!

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:18.990
Moments ago, the Leader of 
the Galette Lion Knights,

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:25.890
Please take a look at the footage!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.600
Regarding the battle competition 
for the people of Galette

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.190
that was scheduled to 
start in four days...

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.440
I have decided to change 
the details a bit...

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.300
In addition to the two recent defeats,

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.780
...and the valiant Countess 
Dalkian has returned.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.990
If we do not act,
it will be a disgrace

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.040
to the name of the Lion Army Warriors.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:53.290
I hereby request another 
battle with Biscotti!

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:58.320
Since this is a sudden request,

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.800
The business association 
and individual business

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.330
owners  are welcome to participate!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:10.270
Of course, we will prepare 
many awards and prizes!

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:14.720
Everyone, now is the 
time to make money!

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:19.110
As soon as we receive 
word from Biscotti,

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.430
There is not much time 
until the battle begins,

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.580
We will let you all know 
the details later on.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.540
We will make sure that 
the information reaches

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.790
all those who wish to participate.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.540
And...

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.760
...there is something 
I would like to wager

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.430
...the treasured sword of Galette
the Magical Battle Axe Grand Vert

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.100
and the Divine Sword Exmachina.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.480
Are you listening to this?

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:54.610
Princess Millefiore...

00:11:56.490 --> 00:12:00.690
We would like Biscotti to provide 
something of equal value.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.900
Something of equal value 
to the treasured swords...

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:06.700
That means we must wager 
our treasured swords...

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.910
It's almost as if...

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:12.040
The people of Galette and Biscotti...

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:17.590
...to fight for your 
country, for yourselves,

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.300
Using the treasured 
swords as a reward...

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.710
But isn't the treasured swords a

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:32.770
symbol of the ruler of a country?

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:35.520
Of course, but sometimes
countries

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.050
would temporarily loan out the swords...

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:41.550
...as a sign of friendship 
between the countries.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:45.950
The people would think 
it's something like that.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.540
But I can't help feeling there's 
something different this time...

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:53.870
I wonder what is going on 
with Her Highness Leo...

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:58.750
It's almost as if she means 
to conquer Biscotti...

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:02.090
I hope that is not so...

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.780
But the reality is they 
are proposing that

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:10.760
Amelita, may I see the battle 
declaration we received?

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:11.720
Yes.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:17.530
The battle declaration states that
the treasured swords

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:19.980
shall be kept for a maximum 
period of 60 days.

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.780
The exhibition and use 
of the swords will be...

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:26.070
..."at the discretion of the 
country, to be handled lawfully,

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:29.330
and with the promise to return the 
swords within the set period."

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.670
That means that during the sixty days,

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:36.040
Can we not decline?

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.380
But she has grasped the 
hearts of the people

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.840
of both countries in 
her press conference...

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.860
If we do not provide 
our treasured swords,

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.920
In order to compensate,

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:53.220
we would have to use 
much of our resources...

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.590
Oh... isn't there anything we can do?

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:58.230
How troublesome!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.650
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.640
It's all politics.

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.430
We must wait for the Princess and

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:08.750
the leaders of the knights to decide.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.490
Huh? You there!

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.280
What are you doing here?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.500
Uh, oh, I've been caught!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.250
Are you spying on us before the battle?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.710
No, no! Nothing like that!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.200
Huh? That girl...

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:25.630
Emilio! What's wrong?

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:26.800
Leader Pantone!

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:30.100
Um, a spy from Galette has 
disguised herself as a knight...

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.800
I'm not a spy!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:35.000
I was sent by someone

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:37.980
to give a secret message
to the Hero Sink!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.190
That's all!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.320
A message to me?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:50.910
He's here.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:58.110
Gaul... What do you want?

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.620
Isn't it obvious?

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.990
About this battle...

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.000
Yeah...

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:06.630
Godwin and I are against this battle...

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:09.510
There's so much I can't understand...

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.710
We're all wondering
if Galette really means

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.850
to conquer Biscotti...

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.560
Even my sister wouldn't go that far...

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.880
Biscotti and Galette have 
always supported each other

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:28.320
It goes against our principles 
and doesn't even make

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.030
sense
to try and conquer Biscotti now...

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:33.650
It's been announced and the people 
are looking forward to it,

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.780
I will try until the last minute

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:40.910
to get my sister to clarify how the

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.040
treasured swords will be handled...

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:45.750
But if that doesn't work,

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.280
and I don't find out what my 
sister's intentions are...

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.300
You have to win the battle!

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.100
Gaul, why are you doing this?

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:58.140
Well, I just like 
Biscotti... that's all.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:02.350
The food is great, I like the 
people and the scenery...

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.200
And... the battles of Flonyald

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:12.640
...the participants, sponsors, audience,

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:19.080
It should be fun for everyone 
regardless of the result.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.870
Only the royalty should be bothered.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.030
This battle...

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:26.530
it looks like things may 
be different this time...

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:31.970
Enough talk...

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:36.110
Don't tell the princess 
or knights about this.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.470
Thank you, Gaul.

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:41.730
Yeah... Sink, I'm counting on you!

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:45.270
Oh, Gaul! One more thing...

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:47.580
I hear that our Princess and

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.860
Leo-sama used to be close...

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:53.090
Sorry. I don’t know much about that...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.680
She knows the most...

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.740
It looks like Prince 
Gaul has made his move.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.620
That's fine. Let him do as he wishes.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:06.920
This time, I don't expect

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.370
much help from him or Godwin...

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:13.630
Godwin is really devoted 
to Prince Gaul...

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.640
It is a good thing to 
have loyal subjects...

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.390
It will be good for his future...

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:24.690
Before the former rulers of 
both countries passed away...

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:28.860
Her highness Leo took very 
good care of the Princess.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:33.570
It was almost as though 
they were born sisters...

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:35.610
When they were young,

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:37.120
the Princess with her compassion

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:41.660
...and her highness Leo with

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.840
her prowess in martial 
arts and seal power.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:48.620
The two had covered each 
other's weaknesses...

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.620
Even after they both became rulers,

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.180
there was no problems...

00:17:57.020 --> 00:18:00.500
...and though the opportunities declined,
they continued their friendship

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.470
in both official and 
private capacities...

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.950
But it was about six months ago...

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:10.980
Her highness Leo began to become 
increasingly concerned with

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:14.740
how the Princess was taken care 
of and about the knights...

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.490
Concerned?

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:19.740
She proposed that Biscotti 
increase its military arsenal...

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:23.490
...and that we avoid events
that might put the Princess in harms way.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.500
She advised us to place proper 
security on the Princess...

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.580
She was so adamant...

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:35.000
But then about three months ago...

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.860
She became cold, almost as if 
she became a different person...

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:41.260
She stopped all relations 
with the Princess.

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:47.080
The Princess is hurt both 
personally and as a ruler...

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.500
...such a change in attitude

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:53.550
And strained relations 
with a neighboring country

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.320
that we had long had ties with...

00:18:55.620 --> 00:19:00.950
If we lose the treasured swords 
of Biscotti on top of this...

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.090
I wonder...

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.390
Is this really a good idea?

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:18.470
It is what the Princess has ordered...

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:21.810
We must be prepared.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:51.210
Hello everyone!

00:19:58.010 --> 00:19:59.420
Everyone...

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.420
I know you've all heard 
the news this morning?

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:05.600
Her Highness Leo made a 
sudden battle declaration...

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.690
The elders all were so surprised,

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.690
they fell off their chairs...

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:19.260
Countess Dalkian, Yukki!

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:23.490
Hero, Amelita...

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.190
Since I became the ruler,

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.010
Even though we enjoyed the battles,

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:40.490
But Biscotti is not a weak country...

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.990
All our defeats in the past were

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:45.650
because I was unable 
to properly prepare

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:47.100
us for the battles...

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.850
-That's not true!
-No way!

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.610
Thank you, everyone...

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:01.110
But you see, that is why 
for the past six months

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:05.080
we have prepared to make 
sure we do not lose anymore.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.810
The Filliano Business 
Association has prepared

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.630
The young knights in 
training have worked hard

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.010
So...

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:23.320
Biscotti is pleased to 
accept the declaration

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:25.050
of war from Galette.

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:33.320
Of course, we also accept 
the proposal to wager

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:36.400
the Holy Sword Exelede and 
the Divine Sword Palladion.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:40.270
That is because we will not be defeated!

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.690
Let's win this battle!

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:50.660
Let's win and grab hold
 of a brighter tomorrow!

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:33.530
This is fun!

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:36.130
It's so peaceful...

00:23:35.290 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>The War Starts</b>

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:40.140
Please tune in aga- oww Harlan, that hurts!
